  "plain": "Podcast host Jesse Michels relays the story of Dan Sherman, author of a book called Above Black. As Michels tells it, Sherman was told in the 1990s that he was part of something called Project Preserve Destiny, and that while his mother was pregnant with him she was abducted by aliens and the baby was genetically altered. If true, a secret programme would have been working with alien changes to people from before birth."
